  "details": "It seems whenever I join an instance with lots of music my game freezes right when the music actually loads and decides to play. This is generally around 5 seconds within joining the instance. I get a loading screen in SteamVR and the audio freezes (sounds like the last milliseconds of audio is looping infinitely). I have also tested this in new instances and it seems it only happens when joining active worlds where people are already loaded in.",
